      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, the City, at the 1966 Session of the Legislature, sponsored the enactment of Laws 1966, Ch. 611, which authorizes the Mayor, by executive order, to continue such increased-take-home-pay plan during the city's 1966-1967 fiscal year; and",
